        "subject": "LU-18687 build: normalize C flags in kernel Makefiles",
        "message": "LU-18687 build: normalize C flags in kernel Makefiles\n\nRestrict subsystem include paths and put generated configuration\nbefore kernel headers.  Keep Lustre headers available to LNet's\nremaining compatibility users.\n\nDefer the compatibility header overlay until the wrappers support\ntransparent inclusion, so they do not hide native kernel headers.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Timothy Day <timday@thelustrecollective.com>\nAssisted-by: Codex:gpt-6.1-sol\nChange-Id: I8b35b99767f7ea41cc3c590bf35089fb81a1bf2c\n"
